  {
   "id": "sample_1790",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "whether it was cloth or plastic or metal or even if it might be alive. .... Alita closed her eyes and immediately had a sense of the sparkling brightness flowing around her and *through* her.",
